# glycemicgpt ios-unofficial Code Owners
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Order matters -- later rules take precedence over earlier ones.
# Mirrors the org-wide ownership model: the area maintainer team is
# auto-requested for review on the default tree, governance and workflow
# files stay lead-only, and promotions to main are separately restricted
# to the lead by the org-level main update lock. Ownership here is for
# review REQUEST (tagging) only -- develop requires 0 reviews and no
# code-owner review, so maintainers self-merge their own PRs.

# Default: the iOS app is the web/frontend maintainer's area, so the web
# team is auto-requested alongside the project lead on others' PRs.
* @lumose-health/web @jlengelbrecht

